> +			    HDA_LONG_CMD_VENDOR_CHIP_IO_CT_EXTENSIONS_ENABLE,
> +			    enable);
> +	msleep(20);

Isn't this command needed when you recover from S3/S4 or powersave?
If yes, this should be called in the init callback instead of
